        // LegalDocumentsDialog.kt
        "1. Scope & Data Controller (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Domeniu și operator de date (Actualizat: noiembrie 2026)",
        "This Privacy Policy explains how Finsay (finsayapp.com, package com.kynigos.oikonomos) collects, uses, processes, stores, and protects your personal and financial tracking data. It is designed to comply with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR 2016/679), Greek Law 4624/2019, the UK GDPR, applicable United States privacy statutes (including the California CCPA/CPRA, Virginia VCDPA, Colorado CPA, Connecticut CTDPA, and Texas TDPSA), and Google Play Developer Program Policies. Data Controller contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "Prezenta Politică de Confidențialitate explică modul în care Finsay (finsayapp.com, pachet com.kynigos.oikonomos) colectează, prelucrează și protejează datele tale personale și financiare în conformitate cu GDPR UE (2016/679), Legea greacă 4624/2019, UK GDPR, legile SUA aplicabile (CCPA/CPRA etc.) și politicile Google Play. Contact: support@finsayapp.com.",
        "2. Categories of Data Collected & Profile Isolation" to "2. Date colectate și izolarea profilului",
        "• Account & Authentication Data: Name, email address, unique user identifier (UID), and profile photo obtained via Google Sign-In (Android Credential Manager) or Email/Password through Firebase Authentication.\n• Private Profile Details (Strictly Owner-Only): Optional fields such as phone number, date of birth, occupation, and city are isolated in a private sub-document readable and writable exclusively by your authenticated account—never exposed to other users during ledger-sharing lookups.\n• Financial & Budget Records: Amounts, titles/descriptions, categories, dates, payment sources, selected ledger currency, incomes, monthly budgets, recurring bills, savings goals, and member split/settle-up entries voluntarily logged by you.\n• Shared Household Data: Member nicknames, roles (Creator, Editor, Registar), shared ledger links, and an activity log of ledger edits visible to authorized members of that ledger.\n• Preferences & Local Settings: Language (EL/EN), theme mode, reminder schedules, and local merchant-to-category memory." to "• Cont și autentificare: nume, e-mail, UID și fotografie prin Google Sign-In sau E-mail/Parolă (Firebase Authentication).\n• Profil privat (doar proprietar): telefon, data nașterii, ocupație și oraș sunt izolate într-un document privat accesibil exclusiv contului tău.\n• Date financiare: sume, descrieri, categorii, date, monedă, venituri, bugete, plăți recurente, obiective și împărțiri.\n• Registre partajate: porecle membri, roluri (Creator, Editor, Operator), legături și istoric vizibil membrilor autorizați.\n• Preferințe locale: limbă, temă, mementouri și memorie locală comercianți.",
        "3. Bank & Wallet Push Notification Reader (Optional, 100% On-Device)" to "3. Cititor notificări bancare (Opțional, 100% local)",
        "• Strictly Opt-In: The Bank Notification Auto-Catcher (Android NotificationListenerService) is completely disabled by default. It activates ONLY after you review our in-app Prominent Disclosure and manually grant Notification Access in Android System Settings.\n• Strict Filtering & On-Device Parsing: Finsay filters solely for recognized banking and digital wallet notification packages (ignoring personal messages, chats, emails, and OTP/2FA codes). Merchant name and transaction amount are parsed 100% locally in device memory.\n• Zero Transmission & Explicit Save: Raw notification text is NEVER uploaded to Finsay servers, logged externally, or shared with third parties. Detected alerts create a local draft only; an expense is saved and synced to the cloud ONLY if you actively tap Save/Confirm.\n• No Bank Credentials / No Open Banking: Finsay never collects banking logins, passwords, card numbers, PINs, or PSD2/Open Banking tokens.\n• Revocation: You may disable this feature anytime in App Settings or Android System Settings." to "• Strict cu acord: dezactivat implicit; pornește doar după acordarea manuală a accesului în setările Android.\n• Filtrare strictă locală: citește doar notificările băncilor/portofelelor acceptate (ignoră mesaje, SMS, e-mailuri și coduri OTP) exclusiv pe dispozitiv.\n• Fără transmitere: textul nu este niciodată încărcat sau partajat; creează doar o ciornă locală salvată la confirmarea ta.\n• Fără date bancare: nu colectează parole bancare, numere de card, PIN-uri sau tokenuri PSD2.\n• Revocare: dezactivabil oricând.",
        "4. Camera, Receipt OCR, AADE/e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. Cameră, OCR bonuri, QR AADE și voce",
        "• Camera & Photo Picker: Camera access (CAMERA) or the zero-permission Android Photo Picker is used solely when you choose to scan a receipt or QR code. OCR text recognition and barcode decoding run locally on-device via Google ML Kit; receipt images are not uploaded to Finsay servers.\n• Greek AADE / e-Invoicing QR Verification: When you scan a Greek tax/e-invoicing QR code, the app may perform a direct, read-only HTTPS lookup strictly to allowlisted official tax/e-invoicing domains (e.g., aade.gr and certified Greek e-invoicing providers) solely to retrieve merchant name, VAT/AFM, date, and total amount.\n• Voice Expense Entry (RECORD_AUDIO): Used only when you press the microphone button. Speech-to-text relies on Android's native SpeechRecognizer service (subject to your device/Google speech service terms), and the resulting text is parsed locally into a draft expense. Finsay does NOT record, save, or upload audio files." to "• Cameră și galerie: folosite doar când scanezi un bon sau QR. OCR rulează local prin Google ML Kit; nicio imagine nu este încărcată.\n• Verificare QR AADE: pentru codurile fiscale grecești, aplicația poate interoga doar în citire domenii oficiale autorizate (ex.: aade.gr).\n• Voce (RECORD_AUDIO): folosită doar când apeși microfonul prin Android SpeechRecognizer. Niciun fișier audio nu este salvat sau încărcat.",
        "5. Biometric App Lock, Local Merchant Memory & Device Features" to "5. Blocare biometrică, memorie locală și funcții dispozitiv",
        "• Optional Biometric & PIN App Lock: Fingerprint/Face Unlock uses Android BiometricPrompt handled exclusively by your device's secure OS hardware. Finsay NEVER accesses, collects, stores, or transmits biometric identifiers or templates (compliant with GDPR Art. 9 and US state biometric laws such as BIPA/CUBI). Any optional 4-digit PIN is stored strictly on-device as a salted SHA-256 hash.\n• Smart Merchant Category Memory: Category corrections for merchants/VAT IDs are stored locally on-device (SharedPreferences) solely to improve auto-suggestions.\n• Reminders, Widgets, Quick Tile & App Shortcuts: Local notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS, RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED, WAKE_LOCK, VIBRATE) deliver user-configured reminders and bank-draft prompts. Widgets, Quick Settings tiles, and launcher App Shortcuts operate locally." to "• Biometrie și PIN: gestionate prin Android BiometricPrompt. Finsay nu colectează date biometrice; PIN-ul opțional este stocat local ca hash SHA-256 cu salt.\n• Memorie comercianți: corecțiile de categorie rămân exclusiv pe dispozitiv.\n• Mementouri, widgeturi și scurtături: rulează local.",
        "6. Legal Bases (GDPR / UK GDPR), Zero Ads & No Data Selling" to "6. Temeiuri legale (GDPR), fără reclame și fără vânzare de date",
        "• Performance of Contract (Art. 6(1)(b)): Delivering budgeting, multi-currency tracking, analytics, cloud sync, shared ledgers, and data exports.\n• Consent (Art. 6(1)(a)): Mandatory acceptance of these Terms & Privacy Policy (version and timestamp recorded in your private owner-only profile), plus optional bank notification parsing, camera/OCR, microphone voice input, and reminder notifications (withdrawable anytime).\n• Legitimate Interests (Art. 6(1)(f)): Ensuring security, preventing unauthorized access via Firebase Authentication and Zero-Trust Firestore Security Rules, and maintaining service reliability.\n• Zero Ads, No Data Brokers & No Third-Party AI Uploads: Finsay displays no ads, does NOT sell or rent personal data, does NOT share personal data for cross-context behavioral advertising, and does NOT transmit your financial data to third-party cloud LLM/AI services." to "• Executarea contractului (Art. 6.1.b): bugete, multivalută, statistici, sync Cloud, partajare și exporturi.\n• Consimțământ (Art. 6.1.a): acceptarea Termenilor/Confidențialității și a funcțiilor opționale (bănci, OCR, voce, mementouri), revocabil oricând.\n• Interes legitim (Art. 6.1.f): securitate, reguli Zero-Trust Firestore și fiabilitate.\n• Fără reclame: nu afișăm reclame, nu vindem date și nu le trimitem la servicii AI externe.",
        "7. Cloud Infrastructure, Security & International Transfers" to "7. Infrastructură Cloud, securitate și transferuri",
        "• Storage & Security: Cloud data is hosted on Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore with TLS encryption in transit, AES encryption at rest, Firebase Authentication, and Zero-Trust Security Rules restricting reads/writes to authorized ledger members.\n• International Data Transfers: Because Google Cloud / Firebase operates global infrastructure (including EU and US servers), any transfers outside the EEA or UK are safeguarded by EU Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs), the UK International Data Transfer Addendum, and Google LLC's certification under the EU-US / UK-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play Services: Finsay Pro purchases are processed exclusively by Google Play Billing (we never see or store payment card details). Native Google Play In-App Updates and In-App Review APIs may run discreetly under Google's Privacy Policy." to "• Securitate: date găzduite pe Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore cu criptare TLS/AES și reguli Zero-Trust.\n• Transferuri internaționale: protejate prin Clauze Contractuale Standard UE și EU-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play: achizițiile Finsay Pro se fac exclusiv prin Google Play Billing; nu vedem niciodată datele cardului.",
        "8. Data Retention, Exports & Permanent Account Deletion" to "8. Păstrare date, exporturi și ștergere cont",
        "• Retention: We retain your account and ledger data only for as long as your account remains active or until you delete specific entries or your entire account.\n• Data Portability: You may export your expenses, incomes, balances, and member settle-up summaries to Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf), or CSV (.csv) locally on-device anytime.\n• Immediate Account Deletion: You may permanently delete your account, private profile, owned ledgers, and cloud/local data directly in the app (Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account) or via https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html. Residual cloud backups are purged within standard infrastructure cycles (up to 30 days)." to "• Păstrare: cât timp contul este activ sau până la ștergerea datelor.\n• Portabilitate: exportă în Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf) sau CSV (.csv) oricând.\n• Ștergere imediată: din Meniu (☰) > Profil > Șterge contul sau pe https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html (copiile reziduale se șterg în max. 30 de zile).",
        "9. Your Rights (Greece, EU/EEA, UK & United States)" to "9. Drepturile tale (UE/SEE, Marea Britanie și SUA)",
        "• Greece, EU/EEA & UK (GDPR / Law 4624/2019 / UK GDPR): You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, data portability, object, withdraw consent at any time, and lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority—including the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (HDPA, www.dpa.gr) or the UK ICO.\n• United States (California CCPA/CPRA & State Privacy Laws — VA, CO, CT, UT, TX, etc.): US residents have the right to know/access personal information collected, request deletion, request correction of inaccurate data, obtain a portable copy, and receive non-discriminatory treatment when exercising privacy rights. Finsay DOES NOT \"sell\" personal information and DOES NOT \"share\" personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising. Sensitive personal information is used strictly as necessary to provide requested app features.\n• Exercising Rights: Use in-app tools or email support@finsayapp.com; we verify and respond within 30 days (or the statutory period under applicable law)." to "• UE/SEE și UK (GDPR): drept de acces, rectificare, ștergere, restricționare, portabilitate, opoziție, retragere consimțământ și plângere la autoritatea de supraveghere (ANSPDCP / HDPA www.dpa.gr).\n• SUA (CCPA/CPRA și legi statale): drepturi de acces, ștergere, corectare și portabilitate fără discriminare.\n• Exercitare: din aplicație sau la support@finsayapp.com (răspuns în 30 de zile).",
        "10. Children's Privacy (COPPA & GDPR Art. 8) & Changes" to "10. Confidențialitatea copiilor și modificări",
        "• Children's Privacy: Finsay is not intended for children under 13 years of age (US COPPA) or under 16 years of age (or the applicable digital consent age in your EU/EEA/UK country under GDPR Art. 8). We do not knowingly collect data from children; contact support@finsayapp.com for immediate deletion if you believe a child provided data.\n• Policy Updates: We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect new features or legal requirements. Material changes will be notified in-app or on finsayapp.com." to "• Copii: aplicația nu este destinată copiilor sub 13 ani (COPPA) sau 16 ani în UE/SEE (ori vârsta legală locală). Scrie la support@finsayapp.com pentru ștergere imediată.\n• Actualizări: modificările importante vor fi anunțate în aplicație sau pe finsayapp.com.",
        "1. Acceptance of Terms & Eligibility (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Acceptarea termenilor și eligibilitate (Actualizat: noiembrie 2026)",
        "By downloading, installing, registering for, or using Finsay (finsayapp.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy. You must be at least 16 years old in the EU/EEA/UK (or the applicable legal digital consent age in your jurisdiction) and at least 13 years old in the United States (or have verifiable parental consent where required) to use Finsay. If you do not agree, do not use the application." to "Descărcând sau folosind Finsay (finsayapp.com), accepți acești Termeni de utilizare și Politica de Confidențialitate. Trebuie să ai cel puțin 16 ani în UE/SEE/UK (sau vârsta legală aplicabilă) și 13 ani în SUA. Dacă nu ești de acord, nu folosi aplicația.",
        "2. Service Description & Strict Financial / Tax Advice Disclaimer" to "2. Descrierea serviciului și excluderea consultanței",
        "Finsay is an informational personal and household expense, income, budget, multi-currency, and split-tracking tool. Finsay DOES NOT provide financial, investment, banking, accounting, legal, or tax advice, nor does it execute payments, currency conversions, or money transfers. Displayed currencies are purely organizational labels; Finsay does not perform regulated foreign-exchange brokerage. You remain solely responsible for verifying all figures, tax obligations, and financial decisions." to "Finsay este un instrument informativ pentru evidența cheltuielilor, veniturilor, bugetelor și împărțirilor. Nu oferă consultanță financiară, fiscală sau juridică și nu execută plăți ori schimburi valutare. Rămâi responsabil pentru verificarea sumelor.",
        "3. Bank Notification Reader Disclaimer (No Open Banking / PSD2)" to "3. Excludere Open Banking / PSD2 pentru cititorul bancar",
        "• Independent Local Utility: The optional Bank Notification Auto-Catcher reads Android payment notifications solely on-device after your explicit system authorization. Finsay is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any bank, card issuer, or payment institution, and does NOT operate as a PSD2 / Open Banking Account Information Service Provider (AISP) or Payment Initiation Service Provider (PISP).\n• Best-Effort Accuracy: Because banks frequently change notification wording and Android battery/OEM policies may delay or restrict background delivery, Finsay cannot guarantee that every card payment will be detected or parsed with 100% accuracy. You must review and confirm every draft before saving and rely on official bank statements for authoritative records." to "• Utilitar local independent: citește notificările doar local după autorizarea ta. Finsay nu este afiliat băncilor și nu oferă servicii PSD2 / Open Banking.\n• Verificare necesară: confirmă mereu fiecare ciornă și bazează-te pe extrasele bancare oficiale.",
        "4. Receipt OCR, AADE / e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. OCR bonuri, QR AADE și introducere vocală",
        "Optical character recognition (OCR), QR receipt lookups (including direct read-only queries to allowlisted Greek tax/e-invoicing portals such as AADE), and voice-to-text parsing are automated convenience features that may occasionally misread text, speech, dates, or totals. Finsay is not affiliated with AADE or any e-invoicing provider. You are solely responsible for checking and correcting auto-filled values against original receipts before saving." to "OCR, citirea QR AADE și dictarea vocală sunt funcții automate care pot conține erori ocazionale. Finsay nu este afiliat AADE. Verifică mereu valorile înainte de salvare.",
        "5. Shared Households, Member Roles & Third-Party Consent" to "5. Registre partajate, roluri și acordul terților",
        "When creating or participating in a shared ledger (Creator, Editor, Registar), you acknowledge that financial entries, split balances, and ledger activity logs are visible to all authorized members of that ledger according to their roles. You represent and warrant that you have obtained appropriate consent before entering another individual's personal information or inviting them to a shared ledger, and you are responsible for managing member access in ledgers you control." to "Participând la un registru partajat (Creator, Editor, Operator), accepți ca intrările, soldurile și istoricul să fie vizibile membrilor autorizați și confirmi că ai acordul persoanelor invitate.",
        "6. Account Security, Optional App Lock & Data Exports" to "6. Securitatea contului, blocarea aplicației și exporturi",
        "• Credentials & Local App Lock: You are responsible for safeguarding your sign-in credentials and device. Optional Biometric/PIN App Lock is a local convenience safeguard; if you forget your PIN or lose device biometric access, recovery may require re-authentication or reinstalling the app.\n• Exported Files: When you export reports (Excel, PDF, CSV) and share them via third-party apps (email, messaging, cloud drives), those exported copies leave Finsay's control and their confidentiality becomes your sole responsibility." to "• Date de acces și blocare: protejează-ți contul și dispozitivul. Dacă uiți PIN-ul local poate fi necesară reconectarea sau reinstalarea.\n• Fișiere exportate: confidențialitatea rapoartelor (Excel, PDF, CSV) partajate prin aplicații terțe este responsabilitatea ta.",
        "7. Finsay Pro Subscriptions, Renewals & Refunds (Google Play)" to "7. Abonamente Finsay Pro, reînnoiri și rambursări",
        "• Billing & Auto-Renewal: Certain advanced features (such as Bank Notification Auto-Catcher, multiple ledgers, and unlimited members) require a Finsay Pro subscription or lifetime purchase processed exclusively via Google Play Billing. Recurring subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled in Google Play settings before the end of the current billing period.\n• Refunds & Consumer Rights: Pricing, cancellations, and refund requests are governed by Google Play's billing policies and applicable mandatory consumer laws in your jurisdiction (including statutory EU/UK withdrawal rights where applicable and US consumer statutes)." to "• Facturare: funcțiile avansate necesită Finsay Pro prin Google Play Billing. Abonamentele se reînnoiesc automat dacă nu sunt anulate în Google Play.\n• Rambursări: guvernate de politicile Google Play și legislația obligatorie privind protecția consumatorilor.",
        "8. Acceptable Use & Intellectual Property" to "8. Utilizare acceptabilă și proprietate intelectuală",
        "You agree not to misuse Finsay, bypass authentication or security rules, attempt unauthorized access to other users' data, reverse-engineer or copy proprietary components except as permitted by mandatory law, or use the app for fraudulent or unlawful purposes. All Finsay trademarks, branding, design, and software remain the intellectual property of Finsay and its creators." to "Ești de acord să nu folosești abuziv Finsay, să nu ocolești securitatea, să nu accesezi neautorizat datele altora și să nu copiezi software-ul. Mărcile, designul și codul aparțin Finsay.",
        "9. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability" to "9. Excluderea garanțiilor și limitarea răspunderii",
        "To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Finsay is provided \"AS IS\" and \"AS AVAILABLE\" without warranties of uninterrupted operation or error-free parsing. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Finsay and its developers shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, punitive, or consequential damages, missed bill reminders, unparsed notifications, or loss of profits/data; aggregate liability shall not exceed the total amount paid by you for Finsay Pro during the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.\n• Statutory Carve-Out (EU/UK/US): Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits liability that cannot legally be excluded under mandatory law (including gross negligence, willful misconduct, fraud, or mandatory statutory consumer rights in the EU/EEA, UK, or US states)." to "În măsura permisă de lege, Finsay este furnizat \"CA ATARE\" fără garanții de funcționare neîntreruptă. Răspunderea totală nu depășește suma plătită pentru Finsay Pro în ultimele 12 luni, fără a afecta drepturile imperative ale consumatorilor (UE/SEE, UK, SUA).",
        "10. Termination, Changes, Governing Law & International Consumer Rights" to "10. Încetare, modificări și lege aplicabilă",
        "• Termination: You may terminate your account anytime via Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account. We may suspend accounts that materially violate these Terms or threaten platform security.\n• Governing Law & Consumer Carve-Out: These Terms are governed by the laws of the Hellenic Republic (Greece) and applicable European Union law, with disputes submitted to the courts of Athens, Greece. However, if you are a consumer residing in the EU/EEA, the UK, or the United States, nothing in these Terms deprives you of the mandatory consumer protection laws or statutory forum rights of your country or state of residence.\n• Contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "• Încetare: poți șterge contul din Meniu (☰) > Profil > Șterge contul.\n• Lege aplicabilă: legislația greacă și a Uniunii Europene (instanțele din Atena), fără a te priva de protecția obligatorie a consumatorilor din țara ta de reședință.\n• Contact: support@finsayapp.com."
    )
